doctype html
html(lang='en')

    head
        meta(charset='utf-8')
        meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
        meta(name='description', content='A real-world strawberry dataset with bounding boxes, five keypoints, ripeness labels, and occlusion labels for agricultural vision research.')
        meta(name='theme-color', content='#111914')
        meta(property='og:type', content='website')
        meta(property='og:title', content='Strawberry Dataset')
        meta(property='og:description', content='Real-world strawberry imagery with structured annotations for localization, geometry, ripeness, and occlusion.')
        meta(property='og:url', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        meta(property='og:image', content='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/assets/og-strawberry-dataset.jpg')
        meta(name='twitter:card', content='summary_large_image')
        title Strawberry Dataset — Real-world annotations for agricultural vision

        link(rel='canonical', href='https://strawberry-vision-dataset.yuhao-jin.chatgpt.site/')
        link(rel='icon', type='image/png', href='assets/strawberry-favicon.png')
        include includes/css.pug

    body
        a.skip-link(href='#main-content') Skip to content

        include includes/navbar.pug

        main#main-content
            header#overview.hero-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .row.g-5.align-items-center
                        .col-lg-6
                            .hero-copy
                                .eyebrow
                                    span.eyebrow-dot
                                    | Real-world agricultural vision data
                                h1.hero-title
                                    | See every strawberry.
                                    span Train for every condition.
                                p.hero-lead
                                    | A structured strawberry dataset with bounding boxes, five keypoints, ripeness labels, and occlusion labels—built from real greenhouse scenes.
                                .hero-actions
                                    a.btn.btn-primary.btn-lg(href='https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ul6L7jNT5VSTEdgTZroezA?pwd=pgna', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer')
                                        | Download dataset
                                        i.bi.bi-arrow-up-right(aria-hidden='true')
                                    a.btn.btn-ghost.btn-lg(href='#annotations') Explore annotations
                                ul.hero-notes(aria-label='Dataset highlights')
                                    li
                                        i.bi.bi-check-circle-fill(aria-hidden='true')
                                        | Instance-level labels
                                    li
                                        i.bi.bi-check-circle-fill(aria-hidden='true')
                                        | Natural lighting and occlusion
                                    li
                                        i.bi.bi-check-circle-fill(aria-hidden='true')
                                        | Research-ready structure
                        .col-lg-6
                            figure.hero-visual
                                .annotation-stage
                                    img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='Strawberries growing in a greenhouse with an example bounding box and keypoint overlay', width='1280', height='720', fetchpriority='high')
                                    .annotation-box.annotation-box--hero(aria-hidden='true')
                                        span.annotation-label strawberry
                                    span.keypoint.keypoint--1(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.keypoint.keypoint--2(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.keypoint.keypoint--3(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.keypoint.keypoint--4(aria-hidden='true')
                                    span.keypoint.keypoint--5(aria-hidden='true')
                                    .visual-badge.visual-badge--top
                                        span.badge-value 5
                                        span.badge-label keypoints
                                    .visual-badge.visual-badge--bottom
                                        i.bi.bi-bounding-box-circles(aria-hidden='true')
                                        span instance annotation
                                figcaption Real greenhouse imagery, shown with an illustrative annotation overlay.

            section.dataset-rail(aria-label='Annotation summary')
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .rail-grid
                        .rail-item
                            strong 1
                            span bounding box
                        .rail-item
                            strong 5
                            span anatomical keypoints
                        .rail-item
                            strong 2
                            span attribute labels
                        .rail-item
                            strong 1
                            span unified record

            section#dataset.content-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .row.g-5.align-items-end
                        .col-lg-7
                            .section-kicker Dataset overview
                            h2.section-title Built for strawberries in the wild—not on a white background.
                        .col-lg-5
                            p.section-intro
                                | Real plants create difficult vision problems: overlapping fruit, changing color, foliage, uneven light, and partial visibility. The dataset keeps those conditions instead of cleaning them away.
                    .overview-grid
                        article.overview-card.overview-card--feature
                            .overview-icon
                                i.bi.bi-camera(aria-hidden='true')
                            h3 Real scenes
                            p Captured in greenhouse environments where leaves, stems, flowers, and neighboring fruit remain part of the visual context.
                        article.overview-card
                            .overview-icon
                                i.bi.bi-layers(aria-hidden='true')
                            h3 Multi-task labels
                            p One record can support localization, keypoint estimation, ripeness classification, and occlusion reasoning.
                        article.overview-card
                            .overview-icon
                                i.bi.bi-robot(aria-hidden='true')
                            h3 Research focused
                            p A practical starting point for agricultural perception, grading, monitoring, and robotic harvesting studies.

            section#annotations.content-section.content-section--tinted
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading
                        .section-kicker Annotation design
                        h2.section-title One strawberry, four complementary signals.
                        p.section-intro Each annotation describes where the fruit is, how it is shaped, and the conditions in which it appears.
                    .annotation-grid
                        article.annotation-card
                            .annotation-number 01
                            .annotation-icon
                                i.bi.bi-bounding-box-circles(aria-hidden='true')
                            h3 Bounding box
                            p Defines the visible fruit instance for detection and localization tasks.
                            span.task-tag Detection
                        article.annotation-card
                            .annotation-number 02
                            .annotation-icon
                                i.bi.bi-bezier2(aria-hidden='true')
                            h3 Five keypoints
                            p Captures landmark geometry for pose, shape, and grasp-related reasoning.
                            span.task-tag Keypoint estimation
                        article.annotation-card
                            .annotation-number 03
                            .annotation-icon
                                i.bi.bi-palette2(aria-hidden='true')
                            h3 Ripeness
                            p Adds a categorical maturity signal to support visual grading experiments.
                            span.task-tag Classification
                        article.annotation-card
                            .annotation-number 04
                            .annotation-icon
                                i.bi.bi-eye(aria-hidden='true')
                            h3 Occlusion
                            p Records visibility conditions so models can be evaluated beyond ideal views.
                            span.task-tag Robustness

            section#examples.content-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .section-heading.section-heading--split
                        .section-heading-copy
                            .section-kicker Label examples
                            h2.section-title From image to structured supervision.
                        p.section-intro The same greenhouse scene can support multiple learning objectives without losing its real-world complexity.
                    .examples-grid
                        article.example-card
                            .example-media.example-media--ripe
                                img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='Close crop of fully ripe strawberries', width='1280', height='720', loading='lazy')
                                .example-chip R0 · fully ripe
                                .annotation-box.annotation-box--example(aria-hidden='true')
                            .example-body
                                span.example-index 01
                                div
                                    h3 Ripeness label
                                    p Mature fruit remains visible alongside unripe fruit for meaningful color variation.
                        article.example-card
                            .example-media.example-media--occlusion
                                img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='Strawberries and foliage demonstrating a clear visibility condition', width='1280', height='720', loading='lazy')
                                .example-chip O2 · unobstructed
                                .occlusion-guide(aria-hidden='true')
                            .example-body
                                span.example-index 02
                                div
                                    h3 Occlusion label
                                    p Visibility metadata separates clear instances from partially hidden observations.
                        article.example-card
                            .example-media.example-media--keypoints
                                img(src='assets/strawberry-field.webp', alt='A strawberry crop with five illustrative landmark points', width='1280', height='720', loading='lazy')
                                .example-chip 5 landmarks
                                .mini-point.mini-point--1(aria-hidden='true')
                                .mini-point.mini-point--2(aria-hidden='true')
                                .mini-point.mini-point--3(aria-hidden='true')
                                .mini-point.mini-point--4(aria-hidden='true')
                                .mini-point.mini-point--5(aria-hidden='true')
                            .example-body
                                span.example-index 03
                                div
                                    h3 Keypoint geometry
                                    p Five landmarks add shape-aware supervision beyond a rectangular detection target.

            section#download.download-section
                .container.px-4.px-lg-5
                    .download-panel
                        .download-copy
                            .section-kicker.section-kicker--light Get the data
                            h2 Start exploring the strawberry dataset.
                            p Download the current dataset package and inspect its images and annotation records.
                        .download-actions
                            a.btn.btn-light.btn-lg(href='https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ul6L7jNT5VSTEdgTZroezA?pwd=pgna', target='_blank', rel='noopener noreferrer')
                                i.bi.bi-download(aria-hidden='true')
                                | Download from Baidu Netdisk
                            span.download-code Access code: pgna

        include includes/footer.pug
        include includes/scripts.pug
